  m_Name: Right 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  speakerName: ROXANNE
  line: That note was written six weeks ago. The room register shows a shift-change
    request I submitted to Valentino - dated. I was asking to come off the double
    floor shifts. I was tired. I can't do this anymore meant the hours. Nobody read
    the date.
